 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.54,
   "end": 1.57,
   "text": "Hello, teachers!"
  },
  {
   "start": 1.94,
   "end": 3.75,
   "text": "Today, messages to parents."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.09,
   "end": 5.89,
   "text": "A note to parents has to be short."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.3,
   "end": 7.27,
   "text": "kind and clear."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.83,
   "end": 10.02,
   "text": "An AI can draft one in seconds."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.33,
   "end": 11.49,
   "text": "but it guesses the tone."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.96,
   "end": 13.38,
   "text": "and it usually guesses wrong."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.33,
   "end": 16.1,
   "text": "Ask for a message about reading."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.5,
   "end": 17.99,
   "text": "and you get an office circular."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.46,
   "end": 19.94,
   "text": "Dear parent or guardian"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.31,
   "end": 21.89,
   "text": "It has been observed and so on."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.33,
   "end": 24.42,
   "text": "Parents stop reading at the second line."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.37,
   "end": 26.72,
   "text": "So tell it three things."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.13,
   "end": 27.94,
   "text": "Who is rating?"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.34,
   "end": 29.44,
   "text": "the tone you want."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.78,
   "end": 31.52,
   "text": "and the one thing parents should do."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.93,
   "end": 34.34,
   "text": "then read it once as apparent before you send it."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.19,
   "end": 36.39,
   "text": "Our example today."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.66,
   "end": 40.29,
   "text": "is a note asking parents to help with reading practice at home."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.98,
   "end": 43.78,
   "text": "First, say who is reading and where."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.18,
   "end": 46.44,
   "text": "A parent on a phone needs four lines."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.71,
   "end": 47.49,
   "text": "not a circular."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.38,
   "end": 50.47,
   "text": "The AI does not know your parents."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.78,
   "end": 54.12,
   "text": "It does not know that most of them will open this on WhatsApp."
  },
  {
   "start": 54.62,
   "end": 57.22,
   "text": "on a small screen on the bus home from work."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.69,
   "end": 58.76,
   "text": "when it does not know."
  },
  {
   "start": 59.16,
   "end": 60.58,
   "text": "It writes a formal letter."
  },
  {
   "start": 60.95,
   "end": 63.62,
   "text": "because school letters on the internet look like that."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.47,
   "end": 65.83,
   "text": "Here is the first prompt."
  },
  {
   "start": 66.2,
   "end": 68.32,
   "text": "Write a message to parents about reading."
  },
  {
   "start": 68.66,
   "end": 69.96,
   "text": "The draft begins."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.33,
   "end": 71.84,
   "text": "Dear parent or guardian."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.31,
   "end": 76.8,
   "text": "It has been observed that reading proficiency is below the expected standard."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.18,
   "end": 78.5,
   "text": "Now I add one line."
  },
  {
   "start": 78.9,
   "end": 81.32,
   "text": "Parents are busy and will read it on a phone."
  },
  {
   "start": 81.66,
   "end": 82.6,
   "text": "I send it again."
  },
  {
   "start": 83.03,
   "end": 85.03,
   "text": "The new message begins, Namaste."
  },
  {
   "start": 85.34,
   "end": 87.33,
   "text": "A short note about reading this term."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.67,
   "end": 88.93,
   "text": "It is four lines long."
  },
  {
   "start": 89.53,
   "end": 91.2,
   "text": "No paragraphs to scroll through."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.54,
   "end": 93.54,
   "text": "You can tell it more about the readers."
  },
  {
   "start": 93.91,
   "end": 95.43,
   "text": "Many parents in my school."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.8,
   "end": 98.37,
   "text": "Read Tolugu more easily than English."
  },
  {
   "start": 98.71,
   "end": 101.19,
   "text": "So I add \"Write it in simple Tolugu\"."
  },
  {
   "start": 101.53,
   "end": 104.48,
   "text": "Some parents ask a neighbor to read messages to them."
  },
  {
   "start": 104.86,
   "end": 107.4,
   "text": "Then I ask for very short sentences."
  },
  {
   "start": 107.7,
   "end": 109.16,
   "text": "which are easy to read aloud."
  },
  {
   "start": 110.23,
   "end": 112.0,
   "text": "Do not write, make it professional."
  },
  {
   "start": 112.41,
   "end": 114.56,
   "text": "Professional makes it stiffer and longer."
  },
  {
   "start": 115.19,
   "end": 115.68,
   "text": "for a parent."
  },
  {
   "start": 115.93,
   "end": 118.18,
   "text": "professional means clear and respectful."
  },
  {
   "start": 118.58,
   "end": 120.45,
   "text": "and you can ask for exactly that."
  },
  {
   "start": 122.07,
   "end": 123.4,
   "text": "Second, name the tone."
  },
  {
   "start": 123.8,
   "end": 125.16,
   "text": "Say it in plain words."
  },
  {
   "start": 125.53,
   "end": 127.68,
   "text": "Warm, respectful, not complaining."
  },
  {
   "start": 128.06,
   "end": 129.8,
   "text": "The AI follows it closely."
  },
  {
   "start": 130.68,
   "end": 133.8,
   "text": "Tone is where AI drafts go wrong most often."
  },
  {
   "start": 134.17,
   "end": 136.8,
   "text": "when the subject is a problem like weak reading."
  },
  {
   "start": 137.27,
   "end": 139.14,
   "text": "The AI writes like a complaint."
  },
  {
   "start": 139.8,
   "end": 141.99,
   "text": "and a parent who feels blamed does not help."
  },
  {
   "start": 142.46,
   "end": 145.0,
   "text": "They get defensive or they scold the child."
  },
  {
   "start": 146.01,
   "end": 147.88,
   "text": "In our draft, one line says,"
  },
  {
   "start": 148.25,
   "end": 150.66,
   "text": "Parents have not been monitoring reading at home."
  },
  {
   "start": 151.0,
   "end": 153.86,
   "text": "Imagine receiving that after a 12-hour shift."
  },
  {
   "start": 154.17,
   "end": 156.58,
   "text": "So I add, be warm and respectful."
  },
  {
   "start": 157.21,
   "end": 157.83,
   "text": "not complaining."
  },
  {
   "start": 158.2,
   "end": 159.4,
   "text": "The line becomes"
  },
  {
   "start": 159.67,
   "end": 163.65,
   "text": "Your child is working hard and a little help at home goes a long way."
  },
  {
   "start": 163.99,
   "end": 164.93,
   "text": "Same message."
  },
  {
   "start": 165.27,
   "end": 166.95,
   "text": "The child needs to read at home."
  },
  {
   "start": 167.35,
   "end": 169.12,
   "text": "But now the parent is on our side."
  },
  {
   "start": 169.59,
   "end": 170.95,
   "text": "Here is a trick I use."
  },
  {
   "start": 171.29,
   "end": 173.09,
   "text": "I describe the tone as a person."
  },
  {
   "start": 173.46,
   "end": 177.28,
   "text": "Right like a kind class teacher talking to a parent at the school gate."
  },
  {
   "start": 177.62,
   "end": 181.54,
   "text": "The AI understands a person better than a list of adjectives."
  },
  {
   "start": 182.36,
   "end": 183.94,
   "text": "after the AI writes it."
  },
  {
   "start": 184.34,
   "end": 186.08,
   "text": "Read the message aloud once."
  },
  {
   "start": 186.42,
   "end": 189.22,
   "text": "If you would not say a sentence to a parent's face,"
  },
  {
   "start": 189.5,
   "end": 190.05,
   "text": "Remove it."
  },
  {
   "start": 191.7,
   "end": 193.38,
   "text": "Third, end with one ask."
  },
  {
   "start": 193.78,
   "end": 196.23,
   "text": "Decide the one thing you want parents to do."
  },
  {
   "start": 196.66,
   "end": 199.33,
   "text": "and ask the AI to end with exactly that."
  },
  {
   "start": 200.18,
   "end": 202.12,
   "text": "Most school messages end with"
  },
  {
   "start": 202.55,
   "end": 204.42,
   "text": "kindly take necessary action."
  },
  {
   "start": 204.82,
   "end": 205.54,
   "text": "What action?"
  },
  {
   "start": 206.04,
   "end": 207.17,
   "text": "The parent does not know."
  },
  {
   "start": 207.38,
   "end": 208.58,
   "text": "so nothing happens."
  },
  {
   "start": 208.92,
   "end": 211.68,
   "text": "A message works when the parent knows the next step."
  },
  {
   "start": 212.09,
   "end": 213.28,
   "text": "and the step is small."
  },
  {
   "start": 214.17,
   "end": 215.46,
   "text": "Our draft ends that way."
  },
  {
   "start": 215.86,
   "end": 217.57,
   "text": "kindly take necessary action."
  },
  {
   "start": 217.94,
   "end": 219.36,
   "text": "so I add the last line."
  },
  {
   "start": 219.8,
   "end": 221.22,
   "text": "End with one request."
  },
  {
   "start": 221.53,
   "end": 223.04,
   "text": "10 minutes of reading a day."
  },
  {
   "start": 223.45,
   "end": 224.42,
   "text": "Now it ends."
  },
  {
   "start": 224.76,
   "end": 228.23,
   "text": "Could you listen to them read aloud for 10 minutes each evening?"
  },
  {
   "start": 228.57,
   "end": 230.66,
   "text": "That is something a parent can do tonight."
  },
  {
   "start": 231.0,
   "end": 234.69,
   "text": "Even a parent who cannot read English can listen and encourage."
  },
  {
   "start": 235.03,
   "end": 236.36,
   "text": "Keep it to one request."
  },
  {
   "start": 236.7,
   "end": 238.05,
   "text": "If you ask for reading,"
  },
  {
   "start": 238.26,
   "end": 240.84,
   "text": "and homework checks and a meeting and the fee"
  },
  {
   "start": 241.18,
   "end": 242.28,
   "text": "Parents do none of them."
  },
  {
   "start": 242.65,
   "end": 244.16,
   "text": "One message, one ask."
  },
  {
   "start": 244.5,
   "end": 246.12,
   "text": "If you need a reply, say \"How.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 246.49,
   "end": 248.9,
   "text": "For example, reply yes on WhatsApp."
  },
  {
   "start": 249.4,
   "end": 250.95,
   "text": "then you can count who has seen it."
  },
  {
   "start": 251.77,
   "end": 252.61,
   "text": "and give a time."
  },
  {
   "start": 252.98,
   "end": 254.95,
   "text": "Ten minutes each evening is clear."
  },
  {
   "start": 255.35,
   "end": 256.48,
   "text": "regularly is not."
  },
  {
   "start": 258.23,
   "end": 259.49,
   "text": "That is the whole method."
  },
  {
   "start": 259.93,
   "end": 260.74,
   "text": "Who is rating?"
  },
  {
   "start": 261.14,
   "end": 261.7,
   "text": "The tone."
  },
  {
   "start": 262.17,
   "end": 262.98,
   "text": "One ask."
  },
  {
   "start": 263.32,
