   "text": "Do not write, make it professional. Professional makes it stiffer and longer. For a parent, professional means clear and respectful, and you can ask for exactly that.",
   "pieces": 5,
   "i": 33,
   "pause_after": 1.62,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 122.07,
   "end": 123.4,
   "text": "Second, name the tone.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 34,
   "pause_after": 0.4,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 123.8,
   "end": 125.16,
   "text": "Say it in plain words.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 35,
   "pause_after": 0.37,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 125.53,
   "end": 127.68,
   "text": "Warm, respectful, not complaining.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 36,
   "pause_after": 0.38,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 128.06,
   "end": 129.8,
   "text": "The AI follows it closely.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 37,
   "pause_after": 0.88,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 130.68,
   "end": 136.8,
   "text": "Tone is where AI drafts go wrong most often, when the subject is a problem like weak reading.",
   "pieces": 2,
   "i": 38,
   "pause_after": 0.47,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 137.27,
   "end": 141.99,
   "text": "The AI writes like a complaint, and a parent who feels blamed does not help.",
   "pieces": 2,
   "i": 39,
   "pause_after": 0.47,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 142.46,
   "end": 145.0,
   "text": "They get defensive or they scold the child.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 40,
   "pause_after": 1.01,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 146.01,
   "end": 150.66,
   "text": "In our draft, one line says, \"Parents have not been monitoring reading at home.\"",
   "pieces": 2,
   "i": 41,
   "pause_after": 0.34,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 151.0,
   "end": 153.86,
   "text": "Imagine receiving that after a 12-hour shift.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 42,
   "pause_after": 0.31,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 154.17,
   "end": 157.83,
   "text": "So I add, be warm and respectful, not complaining.",
   "pieces": 2,
   "i": 43,
   "pause_after": 0.37,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 158.2,
   "end": 163.65,
   "text": "The line becomes, \"Your child is working hard and a little help at home goes a long way.\"",
   "pieces": 2,
   "i": 44,
   "pause_after": 0.34,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 163.99,
   "end": 164.93,
   "text": "Same message.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 45,
   "pause_after": 0.34,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 165.27,
   "end": 166.95,
   "text": "The child needs to read at home.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 46,
   "pause_after": 0.4,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 167.35,
   "end": 169.12,
   "text": "But now the parent is on our side.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 47,
   "pause_after": 0.47,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 169.59,
   "end": 170.95,
   "text": "Here is a trick I use.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 48,
   "pause_after": 0.34,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 171.29,
   "end": 173.09,
   "text": "I describe the tone as a person.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 49,
   "pause_after": 0.37,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
   "start": 173.46,
   "end": 177.28,
   "text": "Right like a kind class teacher talking to a parent at the school gate.",
   "pieces": 1,
   "i": 50,
   "pause_after": 0.34,
   "at_pause": true
  },
  {
